## Third-party data

This licence covers the source code and documentation in this repository. Data
derived from external sources carries its own terms, recorded per source in
DUMBO-SOURCE-REGISTER.md and in viewer/public/district/source-register.json:

- NYC Building Footprints and MapPLUTO — NYC Open Data Terms of Use.
  Attribution required.
- OpenStreetMap-derived street network, landmarks and routing — © OpenStreetMap
  contributors, licensed under the Open Database License (ODbL 1.0).
  Attribution is required and unconditional wherever this data is rendered.
- NOAA CO-OPS tidal datums — public domain (US Government work).

Any redistribution of the generated artifacts under viewer/public/district/
must preserve these attributions. The viewer displays them unconditionally.
